description: Rules for editing scheme seed data
globs: data/**/*.json
alwaysApply: false
---
# Scheme data
- Do not edit data files unless the user explicitly asks.
- Every scheme needs: id, kind, status (active | verify | announced), sources[] with url,
  last_verified (YYYY-MM-DD), criteria[] with source_ref, documents[], application{}.
- Uncertain facts: status "verify" plus status_note; disputed values go in unknown_values or a note.
- After any data change: run the persona tests and the /admin rule tester; update
  data/expected.json only after a human has checked the official source.
